    "description": {
      "value": "Each specialist's ring is dedicated to a single school of magic, and the ring is covered in symbols and glyphs related to that school according to the creator's arcane studies. A specialist's ring has the trait corresponding to its school of magic. You gain a +2 item bonus to Arcana checks, and a +1 circumstance bonus to recognize magical effects and items of the specific school of magic.\n\n- **Activate:** Free Action\n- **Frequency:** once per day\n\nYou gain 1 Focus Point, which you can use only to cast a wizard school spell of the corresponding school. If not used by the end of your turn, this Focus Point is lost."
